<title>NETHERLANDS: Akzo sees flat full-yr 1996 earnings.</title>
<headline>Akzo sees flat full-yr 1996 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Akzo Nobel NV said it expected full-year 1996 net profit before extraordinary items to be &quot;about level&quot; with the equivalent figure for 1995.  </p>
<p>&quot;As stated earlier, we expect that for the full year net income before extraordinary items will be about level with 1995,&quot; Akzo said in a statement with third quarter results.  </p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
